    sd:notes "Interface specification for the Pearson MTTC score feed: a monthly, one-way, manually-retrieved fixed-width file download over HTTPS GET from a Pearson-hosted website (Data Volume 4MB/month, PROD only, 'Incoming File (Prod & Test): N/A (manual process today)'). Read in full for this ingestion per the task brief's instruction to check it against the MTTC/Pearson integration-status discrepancy." .

